# LIMBIC-system-PACKGE 🧠❤️

[![Project Omega](https://img.shields.io/badge/Project-Omega-blueviolet)](https://github.com/Xover-Official/LIMBIC-system-PACKGE)
[![Version](https://img.shields.io/badge/version-0.1.0--alpha-orange)](https://github.com/Xover-Official/LIMBIC-system-PACKGE)

A biomimetic Limbic System for autonomous AI agents, implemented as a persistent Python daemon. LIMBIC enables agents to have "feelings," drives, and associative memory, moving beyond simple stateless request-response models.

---

## 🌟 Vision
To bridge the gap between Large Language Models and biological intelligence by providing a standardized, modular, and high-performance emotional-cognitive core. LIMBIC allows agents to experience arousal, valence, and Pankseppian emotions, leading to more natural and context-aware behavior.

---

## 🏗 Architecture
The system follows a modular architecture connected by a high-speed internal message bus and exposed via gRPC.

```mermaid
graph TD
    subgraph External
        Agent[External Agent]
        Dashboard[Streamlit Dashboard]
    end

    subgraph LIMBIC Core
        gRPC[gRPC Interface]
        Bus[Asyncio Message Bus]
        
        subgraph Modules
            Amy[Amygdala: Significance]
            Hyp[Hypothalamus: Drives]
            Hip[Hippocampus: Memory]
            PFC[Prefrontal Cortex: Executive]
            NAc[Nucleus Accumbens: Reward]
        end
    end

    Agent <--> gRPC
    gRPC <--> Bus
    Dashboard <--> gRPC
    Bus <--> Amy
    Bus <--> Hyp
    Bus <--> Hip
    Bus <--> PFC
    Bus <--> NAc
```

---

## ✨ Features

| Feature | Description | Status |
|---------|-------------|--------|
| **gRPC Interface** | High-performance external communication for any language. | ✅ |
| **Asyncio Bus** | Decoupled internal module communication. | ✅ |
| **Amygdala** | Fast-path significance evaluation and HALT signal generation. | ✅ |
| **Hypothalamus** | Drive management (Hunger, Safety, Energy, Sleep). | ✅ |
| **Hippocampus v2.0** | Probabilistic associative memory using Bayesian retrieval & FAISS. | ✅ |
| **PFC** | Executive control, conflict monitoring (ACC), and planning. | 🔨 |
| **Emotion Engines** | Pankseppian systems: SEEKING, FEAR, PANIC, CARE. | ✅ |
| **Dashboard** | Real-time visualization of internal state using Streamlit. | ✅ |

